<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-JP Morgan ups FAI stake to 12.1 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-JP Morgan ups FAI stake to 12.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Investment Management Australia Ltd, a unit of U.S. investment bank J.P. Morgan, has raised its stake in insurer FAI Insurances Ltd to 12.10 percent from 11.08 percent.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan said in a notice to the Australian Stock Exchange that it had 37.07 million FAI shares.</p>
<p>The stake is valued at A$24.46 million based on FAI's price of 66 cents, which is one cent down on Tuesday close at 2.55 p.m. (0455 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
